      {
       "type": "text",
       "id": "n7je",
       "content": "Opacity is a percentage in pen.dev, so `opacity-gentle` is 24 where the code has 0.24. It draws the same. Blurs and the shadow are written out; motion is here as a list, since pen.dev doesn't animate.",
